WEBVTT

00:00:55.079 --> 00:01:00.162
The assumption, though, was that you could
address structural racism

00:01:00.162 --> 00:01:04.746
with an earnest conversation
about our feelings.

00:01:05.204 --> 00:01:06.621
My take:

00:01:06.663 --> 00:01:07.829
give me a break.

00:01:08.329 --> 00:01:13.288
To address structural racism,
you need to change structures.

00:01:14.288 --> 00:01:19.371
So in the aftermath
of George Floyd's death,

00:01:19.413 --> 00:01:23.579
my sense is that many companies
are feeling pressure

00:01:23.579 --> 00:01:27.371
to actually deliver
on their diversity goals,

00:01:27.413 --> 00:01:30.163
but they haven't a clue what to do.